  "problem": "Baseline records could be left without a bounded processing disposition. Unknown eligibility could be counted as attempted. Interrupted batches could diverge from uninterrupted membership or double-charge captures. Completion could be asserted while eligible records remained unattempted. Live scripts/research/sweep.mjs could contact CMS/CDC/Census.",
  "resulting_behavior": "compileSweepJobs joins all 3434 corpus IDs to source adapters and disjoint dispositions. Inventory count equals the sum of dispositions. Unknown eligibility is visible and never counted as attempted. Isolated PR-004 records remain isolated/non-searchable. runResumableBatch/resumeBatch reuse unchanged captures, route Census access exceptions, and produce identical final attempted membership to an uninterrupted fixture with no duplicate capture charges. writeDeficitManifest records remaining missing facts and next actions; completion stays false while unattempted eligible records remain. buildSweepReceipt includes all 3434 IDs. Live fetch is forbidden. CLI stays fixture-only and refuses --live. Sealed packages/coverage/accounting/v1.0.0 artifacts, packages/normalization/src and packages/identity/src/schema-catalog.mjs are unchanged. scripts/research/sweep.mjs is not invoked.",
